{"parse": {"title": "9TH-20", "pageid": 97025, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-19\" title=\"9TH-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">9TH-20</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">9TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">20</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.81.B0.E7.83.AC.E5.AE.89.E6.94.BE.E5.9C.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灰烬安放地\">灰烬安放地</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 灰烬安放地</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">In the Place of My Ashes</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>翌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>日<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>灰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>烬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>安<span class=\"color-value\"></span>放<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>方<span class=\"color-value\"></span>结<span class=\"color-value\"></span>束<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>归<span class=\"color-value\"></span>根<span class=\"color-value\"></span>结<span class=\"color-value\"></span>底<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>夜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>并<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>比<span class=\"color-value\"></span>极<span class=\"color-value\"></span>夜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>更<span class=\"color-value\"></span>漫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>长<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10920</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_at_dengtafeiben.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_at_dengtafeiben\"><img alt=\"2_6_at_dengtafeiben\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-2_6_at_dengtafeiben.png/600px-Cg-2_6_at_dengtafeiben.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"201\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-2_6_at_dengtafeiben.png/900px-Cg-2_6_at_dengtafeiben.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-2_6_at_dengtafeiben.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_at_dengtafeiben.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"3216\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi2\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_shoushushi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi2.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi2.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi2.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_shoushushi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熊熊烈火映照在每一个人的眼瞳里——就如同这座岛屿名字的由来一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冬夜燃起的火光之中，科马拉监狱的每一块砖石都在脱落、崩塌，朝着无可挽回的方向溃败。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_matou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_matou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>离开了阿莱夫的控制，科马拉监狱正在瓦解……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>那些囚犯，他们并不是真正的犯人对吗……他们还不知道发生了什么事情！他们不知道监视视线的消失，也不知道操纵者的离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>需要有人告诉他们这个消息，得让他们到安全的地方去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们要设法保障监狱中人员的安全。至少，得等到官方救援人员的到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但重塑之手的仪式……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那艘破败的小船在众人的视线中摇晃着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我会回科马拉监狱去的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>维尔汀，你们抓紧时间出发吧！当这儿的一切都结束之后，我会给你写信的，我亲爱的朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这一路上我们都配合得如此天衣无缝，你该把这个任务放心地交给我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>这不仅仅是协助你们，也和你们背后所代表的组织无关。因为监狱中的囚犯们，也都是我的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我相信你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>在救援中，请注意自己的安全，虚构集。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>如果真如狱医所说，“暴雨”即将来临，虚构集小姐，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>比谁都更清楚基金会那些繁复条例的第一助手陷入了沉默。她知晓，身处时代之中，面对那些对真相一无所知的神秘学家，她一个字都不能多说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>虽然我不知道你们提到的“暴雨”究竟是什么，但别担心！对一位作家来说，所有新奇的冒险都再好不过了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>嗯，我想，没有什么比这两天的经历更具有传奇色彩了，我要把这一切都写进我的新小说里，包括你们大家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你的新小说，我们是否能成为它的第一批读者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>当然！我相信文字是一条跨越时间与空间的河流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>维尔汀，总有一天，我们会在别人的故事里再次相遇的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她最后看了一眼这些可爱的新朋友们，就像她们已经认识了数十年一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩头也不回地跑向燃烧中的科马拉监狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>再见了，我的朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远方的风中传来你的呼唤<br />Escucho algo en la distancia</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在黑暗中照亮我梦想的前路<br />que me indica el camino a la fantasia</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我将前往没有悲伤的旅途<br />y emprendo mi andar a una ruta real</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你的呼唤让我前行<br />hay una voz llamandome</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>归于永恒的国度<br />a otro lugar</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怜爱吧<br />ten piedad!</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我衷心赞颂  你的幸福<br />Por la felicidad yo te canto</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我衷心赞颂  你的自由<br />y por la libertad yo te canto</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人能阻止我燃烧的心灵<br />nada podrá parar ni vencer mi ser</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如故事的回忆中  我轻盈地奔跑  跳跃着<br />como en la infancia voy saltando</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我衷心赞颂  你的幸福<br />Por la felicidad yo te canto……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_matou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_matou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有的访客都相继离去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在遥遥传来的歌声里，监狱的“造物主”静静地望着起火的建筑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直至气喘吁吁的美洲豹出现在码头的一侧。她惊疑不定地看着面前的人类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>梅林先生……您是梅林先生对吗？！终于找到您了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>瞭望塔里究竟发生了什么事情……？在我离开房间不久后，监狱忽然就开始崩塌，瞭望塔也不复存在了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我找了很久，终于在这里找到了您。请随我来，梅林先生，这里并不安全——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>没必要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>雪还没有停，迷宫的一切却早已付之一炬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>所有吉凶祸福，命运的奥秘，都只是一场荒谬的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>丢失了自己记忆、身份和名字的美洲豹，一切都结束了。你不再是被困在科马拉的狱卒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……梅林先生，我听不懂您在说什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱卒后退了一步。属于大型捕食者的直觉让她本能地抗拒接下来的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她有预感，那会击碎她一直以来的信仰，还有她习以为常的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我、我要回去科马拉监狱了。我需要回去维持监狱的秩序，防止囚犯们趁乱逃跑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我先走了，梅林先生，您多保重……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仓惶犹疑的狱卒忍受着烈火的高温，往监狱的方向奔去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-522512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-522512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-522512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>嘿，你！不要乱跑，这很危险！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人顾忌她的呐喊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个又一个的囚犯夺路而逃，面色惊慌地逃离这座崩塌中的古老迷宫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-522901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"135\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅰ：</div><div>我们在荒漠，在恒星，在迷宫……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-523001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">囚犯Ⅱ：</div><div>我们在村庄，做梦，与死亡贴脸颊……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱卒如同一条在海浪中彷徨的小舟，完全无法把握行进的方向。终于，一个瘦弱无力的囚犯被美洲豹扑倒在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>快停下！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-522311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-522311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-522311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>放过我！我想要离开……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-522312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-522312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-522312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你没看到吗，这里太危险了！监狱已经快崩塌了！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……是你，罗贝托。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱卒认出了这名被制住的囚犯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罗贝托，美洲诗社的成员，一个在监狱中热心、善良、安分守己的囚犯。一个逃跑的囚犯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>他们……他们都疯了！我早就知道，他们本来就是疯子……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>这里已经着火了，他们还不愿意离开，还念叨着那些无人在意的东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>我……我帮不了他们，我也没法帮他们，我从来都不理解那些他们提到的玩意儿，什么韵律、派系、主义……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>是的，诗社的一切都很好，理想家先生人也很好，但我受够监狱了，我受够科马拉的一切了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她趴在地上痛哭着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>我后悔了，从一开始，我就不该参加那些运动的，那些反抗根本毫无意义！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗贝托：</div><div>我想去欧洲，去西班牙或者法国，我不要待在这儿了……我想回到玛格达莱娜身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>美洲豹移开了制住囚犯的爪子。对方头也不回地离开了这里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_at_hengge.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_at_hengge\"><img alt=\"2_6_at_hengge\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-2_6_at_hengge.png/600px-Cg-2_6_at_hengge.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-2_6_at_hengge.png/900px-Cg-2_6_at_hengge.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Cg-2_6_at_hengge.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_at_hengge.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱卒走进了这栋她最熟悉的环形建筑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我衷心赞颂 你的幸福</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我衷心赞颂 你的自由</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人能阻止我燃烧的心灵</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜幕下，她看到科马拉监狱如同一堆明亮的篝火，闪烁着前所未有的、撼动人心的亮光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>♫……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jietou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jietou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:133%\">三天前</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>那么，它给你带来了一种怎样的感受呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……感受吗？有时我觉得自己像个学习口语的孩子，正努力地念出书本第一页的第一个词汇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>等等，这个比喻也许并不恰当，需要更为精妙、更为直观的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在青年作家陷入文字的漩涡之时，盲眼的女士已经独自走远了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_matou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_matou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她静静地朝着科马拉监狱的方向走去，来到了藏匿在悬崖与礁石后的码头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那儿，解答疑惑的囚徒正等待着她的到来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>一艘船。去往一片陌生的土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>……一个代表过去与未来的寓言，一个曾经存在、即将到来的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>这就是您所提供的回答吗，阿莱夫先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>不，兀尔德女士，这是一个需要您自己去寻找的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>没有人能帮助您。没有人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>我明白了。谢谢您，阿莱夫先生，我会记住您所对我说的话。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_at_hangchuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_at_hangchuan\"><img alt=\"2_6_at_hangchuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_6_at_hangchuan.png/600px-Cg-2_6_at_hangchuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_6_at_hangchuan.png/900px-Cg-2_6_at_hangchuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-2_6_at_hangchuan.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_at_hangchuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>因此柏拉图年</i></span><br /><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>&lt;So the platonic year&gt;</i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>席卷出新的是非观</i></span><br /><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>&lt;Whirls out new right and wrong,&gt;</i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>而卷入旧的观念</i></span><br /><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>&lt;Whirls in the old instead;&gt;</i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>所有人都是舞者，他们的舞步</i></span><br /><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>&lt;All men are dancers and their tread&gt;</i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>迈入了野蛮铿锵的锣鼓声</i></span><br /><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>&lt;Goes to the barbarous clangour of a gong.&gt;</i></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\"><i>威廉·巴特勒·叶芝：《一九一九年》</i></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "9TH-20"}}